I used shared platform tooling and followed UBS release practices when establishing the CI/CD process for the CubIQ Power BI semantic model. I maintained the model in TMDL and used the pipeline to move changes through the standard release process into production.

I contributed reusable tools and practices to colleagues in Market Risk Platforms. I created MRV reconciliation query templates and a shared dashboard that gave teams a common way to review discrepancies and verify fixes. I also shared lessons from the HVE Core evaluation with more than 50 Marvel developers and validated a repeatable GitLab and DevPod setup that colleagues can use during the pilot.

I partnered with OneRisk to resolve a performance bottleneck in their data-loading pipelines. I designed and implemented a service that retrieves calculated MRV results directly from Databricks using Metric Views. This enabled OneRisk to complete its data loads within the agreed SLA and reduced demand on the shared CubIQ Power BI semantic model.
